{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_014","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Copy page as Markdown for LLMs","location_hint":"paragraph 129","char_start":2456,"char_end":2486,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_015","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"An Offer ledger entry describes an offer to exchange currencies in the XRP Ledger&#x27;s decentralized exchange . (In finance, this is more traditionally known as an order .) You an create a new offer entry by sending an OfferCreate transaction that is not fully executed immediately.","location_hint":"paragraph 141","char_start":2754,"char_end":3038,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_016","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"An offer can become unfunded through other activities in the network, while remaining in the ledger. When processing transactions, the network automatically removes any unfunded Offers that those transactions come across. (Otherwise, unfunded Offers remain, because only transactions can change the ledger state.)","location_hint":"paragraph 142","char_start":3040,"char_end":3353,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_017","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"{\n\"Account\" : \"rBqb89MRQJnMPq8wTwEbtz4kvxrEDfcYvt\" ,\n\"BookDirectory\" : \"ACC27DE91DBA86FC509069EAF4BC511D73128B780F2E54BF5E07A369E2446000\" ,\n\"BookNode\" : \"0000000000000000\" ,\n\"Flags\" : 131072 ,\n\"LedgerEntryType\" : \"Offer\" ,\n\"OwnerNode\" : \"0000000000000000\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnID\" : \"F0AB71E777B2DA54B86231E19B82554EF1F8211F92ECA473121C655BFC5329BF\" ,\n\"PreviousTxnLgrSeq\" : 14524914 ,\n\"Sequence\" : 866 ,\n\"TakerGets\" : {\n\"currency\" : \"XAG\" ,\n\"issuer\" : \"r9Dr5xwkeLegBeXq6ujinjSBLQzQ1zQGjH\" ,\n\"value\" : \"37\"\n},\n\"TakerPays\" : \"79550000000\" ,\n\"index\" : \"96F76F27D8A327FC48753167EC04A46AA0E382E6F57F32FD12274144D00F1797\"\n}","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":3379,"char_end":3989,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_018","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"In addition to the common fields , Offer entries have the following fields:","location_hint":"paragraph 146","char_start":4005,"char_end":4080,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
