{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_026","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Requires the PermissionedDEX amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":4883,"char_end":4934,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_027","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Expiration Number UInt32 No Indicates the time after which this offer is considered unfunded. See Specifying Time for details.","location_hint":"paragraph 155","char_start":4938,"char_end":5064,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_028","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"OwnerNode String UInt64 Yes A hint indicating which page of the owner directory links to this entry, in case the directory consists of multiple pages.","location_hint":"paragraph 156","char_start":5066,"char_end":5216,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_029","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"PreviousTxnID String - Hash UInt256 Yes The identifying hash of the transaction that most recently modified this entry.","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":5218,"char_end":5337,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_030","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"PreviousTxnLgrSeq Number UInt32 Yes The index of the ledger that contains the transaction that most recently modified this object.","location_hint":"paragraph 158","char_start":5339,"char_end":5469,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_031","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Sequence Number UInt32 Yes The Sequence value of the OfferCreate transaction that created this offer. Used in combination with the Account to identify this offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 159","char_start":5471,"char_end":5633,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_032","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"TakerPays Currency Amount Amount Yes The remaining amount and type of currency requested by the offer creator.","location_hint":"paragraph 160","char_start":5635,"char_end":5745,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_033","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"TakerGets Currency Amount Amount Yes The remaining amount and type of currency being provided by the offer creator.","location_hint":"paragraph 161","char_start":5747,"char_end":5862,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_034","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Offer entries can have the following flags combined into the Flags field:","location_hint":"paragraph 163","char_start":5879,"char_end":5952,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_035","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Flag Name Hex Value Decimal Value Corresponding OfferCreate Flag Description","location_hint":"paragraph 164","char_start":5956,"char_end":6032,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_036","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"lsfPassive 0x00010000 65536 tfPassive The offer was placed as passive. This has no effect after the offer is placed into the ledger.","location_hint":"paragraph 165","char_start":6036,"char_end":6168,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_037","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"lsfSell 0x00020000 131072 tfSell The offer was placed as a sell offer. This has no effect after the offer is placed in the ledger, because tfSell only matters if you get a better rate than you asked for, which can only happen when the offer is initially placed.","location_hint":"paragraph 166","char_start":6170,"char_end":6431,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_038","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"lsfHybrid 0x00040000 262144 tfHybrid The offer was placed as a hybrid offer, which means it is listed in a permissioned DEX and the open DEX.","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":6433,"char_end":6574,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_039","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Requires the PermissionedDEX amendment . Loading...","location_hint":"paragraph 168","char_start":6576,"char_end":6627,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_040","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"Offer entries count as one item towards the owner reserve of the account that placed the offer, as long as the entry is in the ledger. Canceling or consuming the offer frees up the reserve. The reserve is also freed up if the offer is removed because it was found unfunded.","location_hint":"paragraph 170","char_start":6648,"char_end":6921,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_041","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"The ID of an Offer entry is the SHA-512Half of the following values, concatenated in order:","location_hint":"paragraph 172","char_start":6940,"char_end":7031,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_042","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"The Offer space key ( 0x006F )","location_hint":"paragraph 173","char_start":7035,"char_end":7065,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_043","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"The AccountID of the account placing the offer","location_hint":"paragraph 174","char_start":7067,"char_end":7113,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_044","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"The Sequence number of the OfferCreate transaction that created the offer.","location_hint":"paragraph 175","char_start":7115,"char_end":7189,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_051630391070_045","source_id":"src_051630391070","source_hash":"a544809d623db977d41eacddfcce89b73bcf192a2f936c2a50b0d327f1fc09c6","text":"If the OfferCreate transaction used a ticket , use the TicketSequence value instead.","location_hint":"paragraph 176","char_start":7191,"char_end":7275,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T18:17:10.472Z"}
